### Erik raises the Malmö price from 1100 to 2000 per night -> 200
# The next call checks that this doesn't touch the existing bookings (VG6)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/listings/{{malmo[0].id}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "price_per_night": 2000 }

### Sara's bookings on Malmö after the price change -> 200, total_price still 4400 and 1100 (VG6)
# total_price was saved on the booking when it was made, so a later price change doesn't affect it
GET {{baseUrl}}/listings/{{malmo[0].id}}/bookings

### Erik sets the Malmö price back to 1100 -> 200 (so the file can be run again)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/listings/{{malmo[0].id}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "price_per_night": 1100 }

### Log out erik, log in as sara -> 204, then 200
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/logout

###
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "sara@stayfinder.test",
  "password": "password123"
}

